# Code style

Canonical sources:

- `docs/architecture/technology-standards.md`
- `docs/standards/typescript-standard.md`
- `AGENTS.md`

Use `oxlint` and `oxfmt`; Prettier and ESLint are not repository formatters.
Use Nx `typecheck` (tsgo). Prefer named exports, functional components, types
over interfaces except when extending third-party interfaces, and no `any`.

Reuse existing helpers and package conventions before adding abstractions.
